@startuml 08-stage-handoff-deadline-reconnect
title Sequence 08 - Stage handoff, hard deadline and reconnect
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

participant "GPT-Live" as G
participant "GPT-Live driver" as D
participant "Runtime coordinator" as R
participant "Workflow" as W
participant "Execution Lifecycle" as L
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Stage handoff (BR-CORE-064, 065, 066) - logic built, no live caller yet ==
G -> D : model proposes next stage
D -> R : Propose(stage)
R -> W : Authorize
W -> W : coverage, technical losses, soft budget, follow-up facts
alt not authorized
  W --> R : rejected (nothing written)
else authorized
  R -> DB : BEGIN, lock execution, check version and attempt authority
  R -> DB : commit source handoff (structured evidence)
  R -> DB : COMMIT
  R -> D : open new voice session for target stage
  D -> G : create session (next stage)
  note right : failed setup retries the same committed target.\nIt never authorizes another stage or creates an execution.
end

== Hard deadline (BR-CORE-070) ==
alt closing handoff committed in time
  R -> L : Complete(progress id)
  note right : no report row or outbox row is written here
else 15 minutes from RUNNING reached without the required record
  R -> L : Fail
  L -> DB : commit FAILED, earlier handoffs kept
end
note over L : first terminal commit wins a cancel / complete race

group NOT DELIVERED - transcript and coverage (IRT T13, T14, blocked on provider event finality Q1)
  G -> D : final speech events
  D -> R : classified observation
  R -> DB : fenced tx: update coverage, follow-up count, checkpoint
end

group NOT DELIVERED - one lost connection (BR-CORE-069, IRT T15)
  D -> R : connection down (detection instant stored)
  R -> R : within 120 s, intent = reconnect,\n2 attempts per episode, 2 episodes
  R -> D : replacement session with committed checkpoint context only
  note right : an observation from the replaced attempt\nfails the fence and writes nothing
end

group IN PROGRESS - model states a stage is finished (IRT T21)
  G -> D : complete_stage(stage)
  D -> R : CompleteStage
  R -> DB : Attest: stage open, clock started, deadline not passed;\nseal with stored coverage, next stage current
  note right : on closing, completes through the lifecycle.\nNothing calls this until the provider part lands.
end
@enduml
